  "critical": false,
  "description": "Zinc distillation from sphalerite (ZnS) ore via roasting at 900-1000°C followed by carbon reduction and fractional distillation (zinc boils at 907°C, enabling vapor-phase separation from iron and lead). Electrolytic refining to 99.99% purity. Hot-dip galvanizing deposits 50-100 \u03bcm Zn on steel via zinc bath at 450-460°C — sacrificial cathodic protection (electrode potential -0.76 V vs SHE) prevents rust even when coating is scratched. Also used for brass alloying (Cu-Zn), die-casting alloys, and zinc oxide production.",
